Steps To Create Mavan Application:

1. Create Mavan Project
2. Add Mavan Core Dependancy
	-spring-contaxt
	-spring-hivernate-core
	-MySql Mavan Dependancy
3. Create Persistence bean/Entity class
4. Create hibernate.cfg.xml
5. Create main the class that retrieves or stores the persistent object.

POM.xml
POM stands for "Project Object Model". It is an XML representation of a Maven project held in a file named pom. xml . When in the presence of Maven folks, speaking of a project is speaking in the philosophical sense, beyond a mere collection of files containing code.


-->Create Configuration Object
